{"id":"8492dafd88e95703","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-lyapunov.md","title":"Lyapunov","display":"df-lyapunov — Lyapunov","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lyapunov","aliases":["58-df-lyapunov"],"display":"df-lyapunov — Lyapunov","depends_on":["[[58-df-differential-equation]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lyapunov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lyapunov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lyapunov — Lyapunov"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfa80659b9d38f63\" href=\"?note=cfa80659b9d38f63\" title=\"58-df-differential-equation\">58-df-differential-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{x}=F(x)\">\\(\\dot{x}=F(x)\\)</span> (state space and vector field)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in V\">\\(V\\in V\\)</span> (candidate scalar function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in X\">\\(x_0\\in X\\)</span> (equilibrium point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lyapunov}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Lyapunov}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lyapunov\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S(V,F,x_0,X,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(V,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,\\mathbb R^n)\\land x_0\\in X\\land F(x_0)=0_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land V(x_0)=0\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\neq x_0\\to V(x)&gt;0)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\nabla V(x)\\cdot F(x)\\leq0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lyapunov\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S(V,F,x_0,X,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(V,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,\\mathbb R^n)\\land x_0\\in X\\land F(x_0)=0_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land V(x_0)=0\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\neq x_0\\to V(x)&gt;0)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\nabla V(x)\\cdot F(x)\\leq0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lyapunov} \\vdash \\mathrm{Lyapunov}_S(V,F,x_0,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S(V,F,x_0,X,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lyapunov} \\vdash \\mathrm{Lyapunov}_S(V,F,x_0,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S(V,F,x_0,X,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lyapunov functions certify stability.  A vector field takes values in the ambient tangent vector space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, not in the state set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-differential-equation","status":"resolved","id":"cfa80659b9d38f63","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-differential-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{x}=F(x)","display":false},{"tex":"V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lyapunov}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lyapunov\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S(V,F,x_0,X,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(V,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,\\mathbb R^n)\\land x_0\\in X\\land F(x_0)=0_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land V(x_0)=0\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\neq x_0\\to V(x)>0)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\nabla V(x)\\cdot F(x)\\leq0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lyapunov} \\vdash \\mathrm{Lyapunov}_S(V,F,x_0,X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{LyapunovStructure}_S(V,F,x_0,X,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1384,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-806","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-